## Hints for Future Agents
The Bash tool in this harness may run zsh or bash depending on invocation. A
snippet that works when you test it is not proof it works for the user. Test
shell snippets under /bin/bash explicitly on macOS, where /bin/bash is 3.2.57
from 2007 and lacks modern parsing behavior.

The template is intentionally verbose with seven mandatory sections and "None"
filler. That is Aaron's deliberate choice, not bloat. Two critic agents
recommended cutting it; both were overruled.

